Background dataset has 500 samples but max_samples=100. Subsampling to 100 samples for SHAP value computation. To use all samples, set max_samples=500 when initializing the masker.
=== parameters ===
reuse lab01 frame; PRIMARY metric = mean daily CS RankIC (+ t / ICIR)
LightGBM=True; SHAP=True
eval: mean daily CS RankIC + net SR (shared costs) + DSR — NOT accuracy, NOT pooled Spearman as primary
cite: Qlib Alpha158 + LGBModel docs; AFML ch.10 bet sizing
frontier: arXiv:2511.18578, 2412.09880, 2606.27100 (TSFM finance evals); LLM agents → P8
TB labels are vol-scaled (k*sigma_t); fixed 2% bands rejected — see lab 01

