ridge    mean_CS_IC=+0.0398 t=4.64 ICIR=2.73 | pooled=-0.0076 (counterexample) | net_SR=-0.383 turn=1.3381 DSR=0.000
gbm      mean_CS_IC=+0.0336 t=4.69 ICIR=2.77 | pooled=+0.0105 (counterexample) | net_SR=-1.470 turn=1.7279 DSR=0.000
