=== Qlib-style workflow (pandas) ===
Qlib: Alpha158 → DatasetH → LGBModel → SignalRecord (official docs)
pandas: features_long ≈ Alpha158; purged folds ≈ segments; LGBM/Ridge ≈ LGBModel; pred_to_ls_pnl ≈ portfolio
